;;; WL_MAIN.C - SaveTheGame / LoadTheGame, ported to YALisp.
;;;
;;; The source streams DOS structs to a file handle. The current stage-05 file
;;; API is contract-only, so this translation returns/accepts one Lisp-owned byte
;;; buffer. Gamestate keeps the original 68-byte instrumented layout. Pointer-
;;; linked objtype records become the port's complete structure-of-arrays actor
;;; storage; all currently-owned live player, map, area, actor, static, door, and
;;; pushwall state is round-tripped. The source checksum algorithm and its
;;; corrupt-save penalty are preserved.

